             +-|-+---+                  +-|-+---+     +-|-+---+
               |                          |             |
               V                          V             V
      (1 2)  +---+---+     +---+---+    +---+         +---+
        ---->| * | *-+---->| * | / |    | 3 |         | 4 |
             +-|-+---+     +-|-+---+    +---+         +---+
